OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses struggle to profit as
OL,4,Afuel prices soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses across the West of England
OL,7,Fsay they are struggling to make a
OL,8,Fprofit as petrol prices soar to nearly
OL,9,F#2 per litre.
OL,11,FDisruptions around critical shipping
OL,12,Flanes like the Strait of Hormuz have
OL,13,Ftightened global oil supplies amid the
OL,14,Fongoing conflict in the Middle East.
OL,16,FRetailers facing higher wholesale
OL,17,Fprices for fuel deliveries are given
OL,18,Fthe choice of passing this increase
OL,19,Fonto the customer, or forfeiting their
OL,20,Fprofitable margins.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
