OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses struggle to profit as
OL,4,Afuel prices soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FPieter-Jon Allis, owner of Stroud Taxi
OL,7,Fin Gloucestershire, said he faced
OL,8,F"continual pressure to lowball" his
OL,9,Fprices in order to retain customers and
OL,10,Fstill stay afloat.
